{"steam_appid":3430340,"steam_name":"Dice A Million","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3430340/2139130331/dcd1dadde8f46732f8c0c31096da3ecdc001ab46/1770464433/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770487299","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257281830/23397f7ef449dbf3e7e5c94807c29b8cf0582773/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1770487299","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/d2f80db4463546931397752eb7641663382b8761/ss_d2f80db4463546931397752eb7641663382b8761.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779994115","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/138bba1947eb79bbb8f1a8e58da92f3f65b88271/ss_138bba1947eb79bbb8f1a8e58da92f3f65b88271.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779994115","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/54aea48f890ca42d34a8c22effe9e984933f3ebe/ss_54aea48f890ca42d34a8c22effe9e984933f3ebe.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779994115","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/9813787d064f9768b12acedc1334bc29f5b28a10/ss_9813787d064f9768b12acedc1334bc29f5b28a10.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779994115","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/a6181a078d23cbbeb9669bddfbf8f2e1608f75f8/ss_a6181a078d23cbbeb9669bddfbf8f2e1608f75f8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779994115"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You like big numbers? Sure, got you covered.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/20fbf04e240ae2b2a5d257947c6e8af4.poster.avif?t=1779994115\" width=1170 height=514 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/20fbf04e240ae2b2a5d257947c6e8af4.webm?t=1779994115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/20fbf04e240ae2b2a5d257947c6e8af4.mp4?t=1779994115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/75f5f25dcc7d93781c3765ce254e23e2.avif?t=1779994115\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras_big/75f5f25dcc7d93781c3765ce254e23e2.webp?t=1779994115 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dice A Million is a roguelike deckbuilder about rolling dice to try and get to a million points. That's the whole <i>point</i>. (get it?!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're trapped in this dice rolling facility, so let's get rolling and try to escape. Combine the effects of more than <strong>120 different</strong> <strong>dice</strong> and discover <strong>powerful synergies</strong>. Get through ever-increasing debts and challenging bosses that will require perfect symbiosis in your bag in order to be beaten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will you be able to push luck to your side?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/2c3d73a75c12f5c461048ed1edea23cf.poster.avif?t=1779994115\" width=1170 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/2c3d73a75c12f5c461048ed1edea23cf.webm?t=1779994115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/2c3d73a75c12f5c461048ed1edea23cf.mp4?t=1779994115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/0a7332b64b5631f2620209aff9856412.avif?t=1779994115\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras_big/0a7332b64b5631f2620209aff9856412.webp?t=1779994115 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is called &quot;<strong>Dice</strong> <strong>A Million</strong>&quot; but dice alone won't get you anywhere far. Gear up your hand with more than <strong>80</strong> <strong>unique rings </strong>with that will act as your passive items. They're always active and trigger wacky effects in your dice.<strong> </strong>Get a bunch of them and you'll be hitting those dopamine receptors sooner than later!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/464cd336c21bcdca36372adcc4334368.poster.avif?t=1779994115\" width=908 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/464cd336c21bcdca36372adcc4334368.webm?t=1779994115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/464cd336c21bcdca36372adcc4334368.mp4?t=1779994115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And most importantly...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break the game </strong><i>(It is one of those)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/6d5494a17a243e017dc6390fee73a938.poster.avif?t=1779994115\" width=988 height=566 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/6d5494a17a243e017dc6390fee73a938.webm?t=1779994115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/6d5494a17a243e017dc6390fee73a938.mp4?t=1779994115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 11, 10, 8, 7, Vista<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 30 MB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Indie","Strategy"],"developers":["countlessnights"],"publishers":["2 Left Thumbs"],"release_date":"Feb 25, 2026"}